    alt="Animalife Ambassadors. Elite riders. Extraordinary partnerships. United by passion. Driven by excellence. Disciplines: show jumping, dressage, thoroughbred racing, western reining, eventing, polo, and 4 in hand carriage."
    width="1365"
    height="768"
    class="amb-hero__board"
  />
